0..77 Comment "//! A rule of a theory whose left side matches a constant under a definition."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..156 Comment "//! The rule `both dark x <=> dark` needs the constant `dark` as the first"
157..233 Comment "//! argument. A source names that constant often by a definition, as a model"
234..306 Comment "//! member does. The term `both unlit x` then holds no redex as written."
307..310 Comment "//!"
311..388 Comment "//! The checker reads a leaf that is a definition by its body, where the body"
389..464 Comment "//! is a constructor of the theory. The kernel does the same. The rule then"
465..488 Comment "//! meets its constant."
489..492 Comment "//!"
493..509 Comment "//! - see: #8283"
